    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is there aren't really any \"small ways\" to fix this. it's not like a bad week, it's just how the system is built. no matter how much i grind, the debt and the cost of living just expand to meet my efforts. it feels like i'm on a treadmill that's speeding up and i'm just waiting to fall off. it feels pointless.",
